000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. FILES4.
000030 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000040 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000050 FILE-CONTROL.
000060     SELECT STOCK ASSIGN TO "stock.idx"
000070         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
000080         ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
000090         RECORD KEY IS PART-NO
000100         ALTERNATE RECORD KEY IS BIN WITH DUPLICATES
000110         FILE STATUS IS STOCK-STATUS.
000120 DATA DIVISION.
000130 FILE SECTION.
000140 FD  STOCK.
000150 01  STOCK-REC.
000160     05  PART-NO         PIC X(4).
000170     05  PART-NAME       PIC X(10).
000180     05  BIN             PIC X(3).
000190 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000200 01  STOCK-STATUS        PIC XX.
000210 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000220     OPEN OUTPUT STOCK
000230     MOVE "P300HAMMER    A01" TO STOCK-REC WRITE STOCK-REC
000240     MOVE "P100SAW       B02" TO STOCK-REC WRITE STOCK-REC
000250     MOVE "P200PLIERS    A01" TO STOCK-REC WRITE STOCK-REC
000260     DISPLAY "LAST WRITE " STOCK-STATUS " (SAME BIN AS P300)"
000270     CLOSE STOCK
000280     OPEN INPUT STOCK
000290     MOVE "P200" TO PART-NO
000300     READ STOCK
000310         INVALID KEY DISPLAY "NO P200"
000320         NOT INVALID KEY DISPLAY "FOUND " STOCK-REC
000330     END-READ
000340     DISPLAY "ALL PARTS IN KEY ORDER:"
000350     MOVE LOW-VALUES TO PART-NO
000360     START STOCK KEY >= PART-NO
000370     PERFORM UNTIL STOCK-STATUS NOT = "00"
000380         READ STOCK NEXT
000390         IF STOCK-STATUS = "00"
000400             DISPLAY "  " STOCK-REC
000410         END-IF
000420     END-PERFORM
000430     CLOSE STOCK
000440     STOP RUN.
